# proto-file: sources/v1/source.proto
# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxcalcs.sources.v1.Source
#
# Form MO-2210, Missouri's underpayment of estimated tax form, for 2025, the
# latest published: Parts I and II on page 1, Part III on page 2, and the
# instructions on pages 3 and 4. One anchor per line the estimated tax rules
# fill, and one per instruction they follow. Part II, the Short Method, is
# not filled: the rules figure every penalty by the Regular Method. Page
# numbers count the PDF's pages from 1.

